  "description": "The Holocaust was the systematic, state-sponsored persecution and murder of six million Jews by Nazi Germany and its collaborators during World War II. It is one of the most horrific genocides in human history. The meme's reference to Anne Frank and its implication of indifference to her suffering are only meaningful in the context of this historical event.",
